<style>

:root{
  --paper:#E9EEF5; --page:#FFFFFF; --ink:#14213D; --muted:#5B6A84; --rule:#DCE4EF; --soft:#F2F5FA;
  --margin:#D64545; --accent:#F2A300; --accent-ink:#14213D; --hero:#14213D; --hero-ink:#FFFFFF; --hero-muted:#AEB9CF;
  --gs1:#7A4FB5; --gs2:#1A8499; --gs3:#2E8A45; --gs4:#D9622B; --essay:#9A7420; --law:#3E5CC2;
  --late:#C2362F; --late-bg:#FCECEA; --ok:#1E7D45; --ok-bg:#E4F3E9;
  --display:"Archivo","Arial Narrow",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
  --body:"Figtree",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --paper:#0A101C; --page:#121A2B; --ink:#E8EDF6; --muted:#94A1B9; --rule:#233049; --soft:#18223A;
  --margin:#FF6B6B; --accent:#FFB61E; --accent-ink:#0A101C; --hero:#1C2742; --hero-ink:#F4F6FA; --hero-muted:#9AA7C2;
  --gs1:#B48CF0; --gs2:#4CC3D9; --gs3:#5FCB7A; --gs4:#FF8A55; --essay:#E0B55A; --law:#8EA6FF;
  --late:#FF7A70; --late-bg:#341B1D; --ok:#5FCB7A; --ok-bg:#15301F; color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --paper:#0A101C; --page:#121A2B; --ink:#E8EDF6; --muted:#94A1B9; --rule:#233049; --soft:#18223A;
  --margin:#FF6B6B; --accent:#FFB61E; --accent-ink:#0A101C; --hero:#1C2742; --hero-ink:#F4F6FA; --hero-muted:#9AA7C2;
  --gs1:#B48CF0; --gs2:#4CC3D9; --gs3:#5FCB7A; --gs4:#FF8A55; --essay:#E0B55A; --law:#8EA6FF;
  --late:#FF7A70; --late-bg:#341B1D; --ok:#5FCB7A; --ok-bg:#15301F; color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 var(--body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px));padding-block:18px 56px}
.app{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--display);font-stretch:85%;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;text-wrap:balance}
.label{font:700 11.5px/1.25 var(--display);font-stretch:100%;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted)}
button{font:700 14px/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:.02em;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
button.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--page)}
button.accent{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}
button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,.cell:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
input,textarea,select{font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--page);border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;width:100%}
select{width:auto}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:64px}

input[type=checkbox]{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;width:20px;height:20px;padding:0;margin:1px 0 0;border:1.6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:50%;background:var(--page);cursor:pointer;flex:none}
input[type=checkbox]:checked{background:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px var(--page)}
input[type=checkbox]:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}


.cover{background:var(--page);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--rule)}
.stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding:9px 12px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.stat:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}.stat:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}
.stat b{font:900 24px/1 var(--display);font-stretch:80%;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}


#alerts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
#alerts:empty{display:none}
.alert{background:var(--late-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--late);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 15px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 16px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.alert p{margin:0;min-width:0;flex:1 1 260px}


.tabs{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:5;display:flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;background:var(--page);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--rule);overflow-x:auto}
.tabs{scrollbar-width:none}.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.tabs button{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 4px;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--muted)}
.tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--page)}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:10;background:var(--paper)}
.views{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-width:0}
@media (min-width:1024px){
  .views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:start}
  .views>[data-view="today"]{grid-row:1/span 9}
  .tabs .t-today{display:none}
  .tabs{position:static}
}


.page{background:var(--page);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;min-width:0;box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--rule)}
.pagehead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.pagehead h2{font-size:24px}
.dayhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
.dayhead h2{font-size:28px}
#day .dayhead,#logpage .dayhead{margin-bottom:12px}
.navbtns{display:flex;gap:6px}
.navbtns button{padding:8px 11px}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.fixes{border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 10%,var(--page));border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.fixes ul,.fixes ol{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
.topics{background:var(--soft);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.topics ul,.lawsub ul{list-style:none;margin:8px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.topics li,.lawsub li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:start;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.4}
.topics .more{margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px dashed var(--rule);opacity:.75}
.topics .more.ready{opacity:1}
.topics .more.ready .label{color:var(--ink)}
.topics li b{font:800 14px/1.4 var(--display);color:var(--muted)}
.items{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.items li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:start;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.items li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.items label{min-width:0;cursor:pointer}
.items .it{display:block;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3}
.items .id{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;margin-top:2px}
.items .mins{font:700 13px/1.4 var(--display);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.items li.done .it{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:var(--muted);color:var(--muted)}
.log{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start}
.log .full{grid-column:1/-1}
.top3{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.saved{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.hist{list-style:none;margin:8px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.hist li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 66px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}
.hist b{text-align:right;font:700 13px/1 var(--display)}
.hbar{height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--soft);overflow:hidden}.hbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}
@media (max-width:480px){.log{grid-template-columns:1fr}.items li{gap:10px}}

.tests{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.test{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.test .bar{align-self:stretch;border-radius:3px;background:var(--kc)}
.test .nm{font:800 17px/1.25 var(--display);font-stretch:90%}
.test .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.test .acts{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center}
.test .acts button{padding:7px 10px;font-size:12.5px}
.test.isdone{opacity:.6}
.pill{font:700 11px/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:5px;border:1.5px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.pill.done{color:var(--ok);background:var(--ok-bg);border-color:transparent}
.pill.late{color:var(--late);background:var(--late-bg);border-color:transparent}
.pill.moved{color:var(--essay);border-color:var(--essay)}
.pill.today{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);border-color:transparent}
.score{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr auto;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.score input{padding:7px 9px;font-size:14px}.score button{padding:7px 10px;font-size:12.5px}
@media (max-width:520px){.test{grid-template-columns:10px minmax(0,1fr)}.test .acts{grid-column:2;justify-content:flex-start}.score{grid-template-columns:1fr}}


.weekdays,.strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}
.weekdays span{font:700 10.5px/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding-bottom:4px}
.cell{border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 6px 7px;min-height:62px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--page);text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
.cell::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:4px;background:var(--kc,transparent)}
.cell .n{font:800 15px/1 var(--display);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.cell .x{font:600 10px/1.2 var(--body);color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;hyphens:none}
.cell.has-test{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--kc) 16%,var(--page));border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--kc) 45%,var(--page))}
.cell.has-test .x{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.cell.sel{border-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink)}
.cell.past{opacity:.5}
.cell.istoday .n::after{content:" ●";color:var(--accent);font-size:12px}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.legend em{font-style:normal;display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
.legend em::before{content:"";width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--kc)}
.weekstats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}
.weekstats .stat{border-bottom:0}.weekstats .stat:last-child{border-right:0}.weekstats .stat:nth-child(2n){border-right:1px solid var(--rule)}
.meter{height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--soft);overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}


.lawgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px}
.lawsub{min-width:0}
.lawsub>.row b{font:800 17px/1.2 var(--display)}
.lawsub .meter{margin:8px 0 4px}
.lawwarn{color:var(--late);font-weight:600}
.tasks{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.task{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr auto;gap:10px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);align-items:start}
.task .due{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--display);letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.task.overdue .due{color:var(--late)}
.task.done span.txt{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--muted)}
.rules{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;max-width:72ch}
#sync{text-align:center}


.overlay[hidden]{display:none!important}
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:color-mix(in srgb,#000 50%,transparent);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:16px;z-index:20}
.sheet{background:var(--page);border-radius:16px;max-width:520px;width:100%;max-height:calc(100vh - 32px);overflow:auto;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--margin)}
.sheet h3{font-size:24px}
.args{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.args li{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--soft);font-size:14.5px}
.args li.bad{background:var(--late-bg)}
.args li b{font-weight:700}
.sheet .btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.cell,.test,button{transition:background .15s,opacity .15s,width .4s}}

details.chg{display:inline-block}
details.chg summary{cursor:pointer;font:700 12.5px/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);list-style:none;padding:6px 0}
details.chg summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.startline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14.5px}
.startline b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800}
.banner{border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 12%,var(--page));border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:14.5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 10px;align-items:center}
.section-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:6px 12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0 8px}
.section-h h3{font-size:20px}
.work{background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px;padding:4px 14px}
.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font:800 10.5px/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--late-bg);color:var(--late)}
.tag.part{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 20%,var(--page));color:var(--ink)}
button.mini{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px}
.opt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft)}
.opt h4{margin:0;font:800 17px/1.2 var(--display)}
.opt p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.opt .row select{flex:1 1 200px}
.sheet .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.durin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.durin input{width:84px;flex:none}.durin span{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
.loglist{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.loglist li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px minmax(0,1fr) 54px;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:14.5px;align-items:baseline}
.loglist .tm{font:700 12.5px/1.4 var(--display);color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.loglist .nm{font:800 12px/1.3 var(--display);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;display:block}
.loglist b{text-align:right;font:800 15px/1.3 var(--display);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;padding:12px 0 4px;font:800 19px/1.2 var(--display)}
.total span{font:500 13.5px/1.3 var(--body);color:var(--muted)}
.rform{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 150px;gap:10px 14px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px}
.rform label{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.35}
.rform input{padding:7px 9px}
.rform .changed{font-weight:700}
.pvctl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.pvctl input{width:auto}
.rulelist{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:72ch;font-size:15px}
.droplist{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.droplist li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;font-size:14.5px}
.tprog{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:480px){.loglist li{grid-template-columns:70px minmax(0,1fr) 46px}.rform{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rform input{max-width:200px}}

.cover{background:var(--hero);color:var(--hero-ink);padding:14px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;box-shadow:none}
.hl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:4px 12px}
.hnext{font:800 20px/1.25 var(--display);font-stretch:90%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.hnext i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;flex:none}
.hwhen{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--hero-muted)}
.hpre{margin-left:auto;font:700 11.5px/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hero-muted)}
.hnow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--hero-ink) 18%,transparent);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.4}
.htag{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);font:800 11px/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:5px}
.htxt{min-width:0;flex:1 1 200px}
.hbar2{flex:1 0 100%;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--hero-ink) 18%,transparent);overflow:hidden}
.hbar2 i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}
.dayopts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin:0 0 6px}
.startrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
.startrow input{width:auto}
button.big{font-size:16px;padding:12px 18px}
.startline{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted)}
details.chg{position:relative}
.chgbox{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:10px 0 4px}
.chgbox input{width:auto}
.todo{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.todo li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:start;padding:11px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.35}
.todo label{cursor:pointer;min-width:0}
.todo li.done label{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:var(--muted)}
.todo .sub{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-top:2px}
.sheet .todo li{background:transparent;padding:9px 0;border-radius:0}
.tt{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.tt li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:9px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);min-height:44px}
.tt .tm{font:700 13px/1.3 var(--display);color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tt li.br .nm{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.tt li.bl .nm{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.35;min-width:0}
.tt li.bl .nm b{font-weight:700}
.tt .hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.tt .sum{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ok);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px}
.tt .sum.miss{color:var(--late)}
.tt li.live{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent);padding-left:10px}
.tt li.paper .nm b{color:var(--ink)}
details.tip{margin-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:12px}
details.tip summary{cursor:pointer;font:700 12.5px/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
details.tip p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45}
details.tip a{color:var(--muted)}
.section-h{margin:18px 0 6px}
@media (max-width:480px){.tabs button{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:10px 1px}.tt li{grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px}}

.reward{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:10px;border-left:0;border-top:4px solid var(--accent)}
.reward .cup{font-size:56px;line-height:1;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:120px;height:96px}
.reward .cup .tro{position:relative;z-index:1}
.reward .cup.prize{font-size:72px;height:116px}
.reward .rays{position:absolute;inset:-14px;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-conic-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 55%,transparent) 0 12deg,transparent 12deg 30deg);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,#000 30%,transparent 70%);mask:radial-gradient(circle,#000 30%,transparent 70%)}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
  .reward .cup.prize .tro{animation:prizeIn 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,1.5,.4,1) both,prizeBob 2.4s ease-in-out 1.1s infinite}
  .reward .cup.prize .rays{animation:raysIn .6s ease-out .35s both,spin 9s linear infinite}
}
@keyframes prizeIn{0%{transform:translateY(-120px) scale(.2) rotate(-200deg);opacity:0}60%{transform:translateY(8px) scale(1.25) rotate(12deg);opacity:1}80%{transform:scale(.95) rotate(-4deg)}100%{transform:none}}
@keyframes prizeBob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(3deg)}}
@keyframes raysIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.3)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
@keyframes spin{to{rotate:360deg}}
.reward h3{font-size:30px}
.reward .what{font:600 17px/1.4 var(--body);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 16%,var(--page));border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;width:100%}
.reward .btns{justify-content:center}
.rwline{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14.5px}
#confetti{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:30}
.run{border-left:4px solid var(--ok);background:var(--soft);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.run.tight{border-color:var(--accent)}
.run.short{border-color:var(--late);background:var(--late-bg)}
.run b{font:800 17px/1.25 var(--display)}
.run p{margin:0;font-size:14.5px}
.run .meter{margin-top:2px}
.run.short .meter i{background:var(--late)}
.run.ok .meter i{background:var(--ok)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.chips button{padding:8px 10px;font-size:12.5px}
.bm{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.bm li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px minmax(0,1fr) 62px 104px;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.bm label{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.3;min-width:0}
.bm input[type=number],.bm input[type=time]{padding:6px 7px;font-size:14px}
.bm .hd{font:700 11px/1.2 var(--display);letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.bmsum{font:700 15px/1.35 var(--display);margin:0}

/* ===== Chambers × Graphite theme ===== */
:root,:root[data-theme="dark"],:root[data-theme="light"]{
  --paper:#0B1912; --page:#12241A; --soft:#183022; --rule:#21392B; --ink:#EDE6D6; --muted:#97AA9E;
  --margin:#C2A26B; --accent:#C2A26B; --accent-ink:#0E1C14; --hero:#12241A; --hero-ink:#EDE6D6; --hero-muted:#97AA9E;
  --gs1:#B9A0E3; --gs2:#82B9E6; --gs3:#8FCB9B; --gs4:#E3A27C; --essay:#D9B96E; --law:#A3B7F0;
  --late:#E8857B; --late-bg:#33201D; --ok:#8FCB9B; --ok-bg:#1A3527;
  --display:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display","Segoe UI",Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;
  --body:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Text","Segoe UI",Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;
  color-scheme:dark}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --paper:#0B1912; --page:#12241A; --soft:#183022; --rule:#21392B; --ink:#EDE6D6; --muted:#97AA9E;
  --margin:#C2A26B; --accent:#C2A26B; --accent-ink:#0E1C14; --hero:#12241A; --hero-ink:#EDE6D6; --hero-muted:#97AA9E;
  --gs1:#B9A0E3; --gs2:#82B9E6; --gs3:#8FCB9B; --gs4:#E3A27C; --essay:#D9B96E; --law:#A3B7F0;
  --late:#E8857B; --late-bg:#33201D; --ok:#8FCB9B; --ok-bg:#1A3527}}
body{background:var(--paper);font-family:var(--body)}
body::before{background:var(--paper)}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--display);font-stretch:100%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.label{font:500 12.5px/1.3 var(--body);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:var(--muted)}
button{font:600 14px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:0;border-radius:12px}
.page,.cover{border-radius:20px;box-shadow:none}
.page{background:var(--page)}
.tabs{background:var(--page);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:none;padding:4px}
.tabs button{font:500 13px/1 var(--body);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted);border-radius:10px}
.tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--rule)}
.alert{border-radius:16px}
.cell{border-radius:10px}
.pill{text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font:600 11.5px/1 var(--body);border-radius:999px}
.test .nm,.loglist .nm,.total{font-family:var(--display);font-stretch:100%;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.weekdays span{font:600 11px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.02em}
input,textarea,select{background:var(--soft);border-color:var(--rule);border-radius:12px}
#day .work,#day .plan{background:var(--soft);border-color:var(--rule);border-radius:18px}
#day .tt li.live{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 16%,transparent)}
/* band */
.cover{background:var(--hero);padding:16px 16px 14px;gap:12px}
.bd{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.bd .k{font-size:13px;color:var(--hero-muted)}
.bd h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.15;margin-top:3px}
.bd .pre{font-size:13px;color:var(--hero-muted);white-space:nowrap}
.rings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.ring{background:var(--soft);border-radius:16px;padding:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:0}
.ring svg{flex:none}
.ring b{display:block;font:700 20px/1.1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.01em}
.ring span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--hero-muted);line-height:1.3}
.ring span.up{color:var(--ok)}.ring span.down{color:var(--late)}
.hnow{border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.htag{border-radius:999px;font:600 11.5px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:5px 9px}
/* thought card */
.thought{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 14px}
.thought .pat{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px}
.thought .gm{font:600 19px/1.45 "Noto Sans Gurmukhi","Mukta Mahee",var(--body);color:var(--accent);margin:0}
.thought .tr{font-style:italic;color:var(--ink);margin:2px 0 0;font-size:14.5px}
.thought .mn{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14.5px}
.thought .do{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14.5px}
.thought .do b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.thought .src{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.thought .src a{color:var(--muted)}
#day .hrbtn{background:none;border:0;padding:4px 2px;font:500 13px/1.3 var(--body);color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline dotted;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}
#day .hrbtn.got{color:var(--accent)}
#day .mininp{width:68px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:15px}
#day .tt li{grid-template-columns:48px minmax(0,1fr) auto}
</style>

<div class="app">
  <header class="cover" id="band" aria-live="polite"></header>
  <div id="alerts"></div>
  <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Sections">
    <button class="t-today" data-v="today" role="tab">Today</button>
    <button data-v="log" role="tab">Log</button>
    <button data-v="tests" role="tab">Tests</button>
    <button data-v="calendar" role="tab">Weeks</button>
    <button data-v="law" role="tab">Law</button>
    <button data-v="jobs" role="tab">More</button>
  </nav>
  <main class="views">
    <section class="page" data-view="today" id="day"></section>
    <section class="page" data-view="log" id="logpage" hidden></section>
    <section class="page" data-view="tests" hidden>
      <div class="pagehead"><h2>Tests</h2><span class="label" id="moveCount"></span></div>
      <div id="gs1run"></div>
      <ul class="tests" id="tests"></ul>
      <p class="note" style="margin:12px 0 0">Replanned 16 Nov. Copies must reach ForumIAS within 3 weeks of each test's release, and every sectional now lands inside its window; ST2 (window 27 Nov) is on 25 Nov with a spare day after it. GS1 gets one week, 5–11 Dec. Spare days on 20 and 26 Nov catch a slipped test, or go to CA catch-up if nothing slipped; when you move a sectional, later ones shift only if they get squeezed.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="page" data-view="calendar" hidden>
      <div class="pagehead"><h2>9 Nov – 3 Jan</h2><span class="label">Tap a day</span></div>
      <div class="weekdays"><span>MON</span><span>TUE</span><span>WED</span><span>THU</span><span>FRI</span><span>SAT</span><span>SUN</span></div>
      <div class="strip" id="strip"></div>
      <div class="legend">
        <em style="--kc:var(--gs1)">GS1</em><em style="--kc:var(--gs2)">GS2</em><em style="--kc:var(--gs3)">GS3</em><em style="--kc:var(--gs4)">GS4</em><em style="--kc:var(--essay)">Essay</em><em style="--kc:var(--muted)">Travel / light / off</em>
      </div>
      <div id="week" style="margin-top:22px"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="page" data-view="law" id="lawcard" hidden></section>
    <section class="page" data-view="jobs" hidden>
      <div class="cover" style="padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:28px">
        <span class="label">How it all works</span>
        <h2 style="margin:4px 0 10px">My system</h2>
        <ol style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;line-height:1.45">
          <li><b>Today</b> builds your day from the time you wake. Gurbani lands in the morning or the evening on its own. Blocks are just study blocks; you decide what goes in them.</li>
          <li><b>Log</b> what really happened, honestly. The coach and the Sunday review read it.</li>
          <li><b>SOS</b> (red button, bottom right, on every tab): <i>I can't study</i>, <i>Junk food craving</i> and <i>Urge hit</i> open a live chat with Claude. <i>Junk food craving</i> is your craving coach, the same one the SOS app's coach button opens. Food logging, your streak and the freedom fund live in the SOS app, which syncs here every night.</li>
          <li><b>9:16 pm, nightly coach:</b> a push on your phone. Open it and reply with tomorrow's first action.</li>
          <li><b>Sundays 5:39 pm, weekly review:</b> your week's pattern, the science behind it, and 2–3 adjustments.</li>
          <li><b>Rules:</b> Opal locks the phone 10 pm–5 am · minimum day = Gurbani + 2 study blocks + the log · every paper is written by its latest date · a lapse is a fork in the road, not the end of the day.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="cover" id="speedCard" style="padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:28px" hidden></div>
      <div class="pagehead"><h2>One-time jobs</h2><span class="label" id="taskCount"></span></div>
      <ul class="tasks" id="tasks"></ul>
      <div id="rulespage" style="margin-top:36px"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <p class="note" id="sync"></p>
</div>

<div class="overlay" id="sheetOv" hidden>
  <div class="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" id="sheetBody"></div>
</div>
<div class="overlay" id="overlay" hidden>
  <div class="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mvTitle">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Move a test</span>
      <h3 id="mvTitle"></h3>
    </div>
    <div class="row" id="mvChips"></div>
    <input type="date" id="mvDate" aria-label="New date">
    <label class="row" id="mvCascRow" for="mvCasc" style="gap:10px"><input type="checkbox" id="mvCasc" checked><span>Shift later sectionals only if they get squeezed</span></label>
    <ul class="args" id="mvArgs"></ul>
    <div class="btns">
      <button id="mvSkip">Skip this test</button>
      <button id="mvKeep">Cancel</button>
      <button class="primary" id="mvGo" disabled>Move</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
